      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "**Problem:** Snapshot loading doesn't validate the announced coin count against the unique UTXOs loaded, and its cache ignores repeated outpoints.\nA snapshot can therefore repeat every coin record, announce the larger count, and still match the committed UTXO hash.\n\n**Fix:** Compare the announced count with the unique coin count already produced by the existing UTXO statistics scan.\nDuplicate records are rejected after the content-hash check, preserving the current error precedence.\n",
